":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-07T08:42:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T10:58:47Z","closed_at":"2025-11-09T10:14:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.stable.official [876b29033], v4.6.dev3.official [9d84f3d13]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Ubuntu 25.04 25.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (nvidia; 570.195.03) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7600K CPU @ 3.80GHz (4 threads) - 30.68 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs mentioned in 2021: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/20228#issuecomment-867873921  \n\nI was looking for a way to clip vertically & horizontally and `clip_contents` does nothing.  \n\n| Expectation | `clip_content` |\n| ----------- | -------------- |\n| <img width=\"241\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2755c634-7362-47a5-b4f2-bd0ce7d5da93\" /> | <img width=\"311\" height=\"252\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8edc99c7-8123-462d-8c6b-5784e8e8b418\" /> |\n\nI attempt to use `clip_text` even knowing that docs mention only working horizontally.  \n\n| Expectation | `clip_text` |\n| ----------- | ----------- |\n| <img width=\"241\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2755c634-7362-47a5-b4f2-bd0ce7d5da93\" /> | <img width=\"241\" height=\"234\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f9f4a0e-f06e-40fd-a3d7-974cc9b74420\" /> |\n\nFunny that it doesn clip vertically when autowrap is on (but I don't want to autowrap).  \n\n| Expectation | `clip_text` + `autowrap` |\n| ----------- | ----------- |\n| <img width=\"241\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2755c634-7362-47a5-b4f2-bd0ce7d5da93\" /> | <img width=\"241\" height=\"186\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a93ea83d-6406-4579-8f77-80baac47b73a\" /> |\n\nI was able to clip vertically + horizontally with RichTextLabel because `clip_contents` work as expected but this nodes uses more memory than Label.  \n\n| 10.000 Labels | 10.000 RichTextLabels |\n| --- | --- |\n| 156MB | 1.8GB |\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create Scene\n- Create Label\n- Set minimum size (50, 50)\n- Set text with:\n```\nLine 11111111111111111\nLine 22222222222222222\nLine 33333333333333333\nLine 44444444444444444\nLine 55555555555555555\nLine 66666666666666666\n```\n- Set `clip_contents`\n- Try to reduce size\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"thiagola92","id":9352894,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzNTI4OTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9352894?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92","html_url":"https://github.com/thiagola92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thiagola92/events{/privacy}","received_e